Description: Show the logo and what is being loaded on the loading screen
 LoadingRenderModule drew nothing but the background, so the window was empty
 for the whole of start up. The splash screen used to carry that information
 but is a separate toplevel that cannot be placed or stacked under Wayland, so
 it is not shown there. Draws the same three messages in the middle of the
 canvas instead, which needs no positioning and no stacking and behaves the
 same on every platform.
